# Normalize line endings in the repository; check out with LF everywhere.
# Matches `end_of_line = lf` in .editorconfig, and keeps the husky hooks
# executable — a CRLF `.husky/pre-commit` fails with "lint-staged: not found"
# on a fresh clone, because core.autocrlf=true on Windows rewrites it.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
